<worksheet>
<title>Class Participation</title>
<exercise number="Week 1 - Day 1" workspace="0.25in">
<statement>
    <p>
        I would rate my participation score for today as ______%.  Comment on any of the participation criteria that you feel you struggled with or excelled with during today's class.
    </p>
    <ul>
        <li><p>I remained engaged and avoided distractions</p></li>
        <li><p>I attempted all problems</p></li>
        <li><p>I contributed to my group</p></li>
        <li><p>I contributed to the class discussion</p></li>
        <li><p>I felt challenged by the material but persevered</p></li>
    </ul>
    <p>
        Respond to the question of the day:
    </p>
</statement>
</exercise>
